So if the engine returned, the result would be written. The fact that result is null means the engine is STILL RUNNING or threw an exception that wasn't caught by the outer try/catch (impossible) or the process crashed.

Let me check if the job is still running by polling again, and also fix the validation to use typecheck-only when bun is unavailable.

